{"id":"techeun-force","name":"Techeun Force","type":"Fusion Rifle","tier":"Legendary","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/f3979aa6240b4ec2049896c0d8125204.jpg","screenshot":"/common/destiny2_content/screenshots/3591141932.jpg","columns":[{"label":"Barrel","weight":1,"perks":[{"name":"Arrowhead Brake","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8f7fb54687aa52a9c2595d90ce9c9417.png","desc":"Lightly vented barrel.\n  •  Greatly controls recoil\n  •  Increases handling speed"},{"name":"Chambered Compensator","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0b451cbccc7f11f6aec9c153e59474cb.png","desc":"Stable barrel attachment.\n  •  Increases stability\n  •  Moderately controls recoil\n  •  Slightly decreases handling speed"},{"name":"Corkscrew Rifling","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7730e1732ed7ef91afce50277639c493.png","desc":"Balanced barrel. \n  •  Slightly increases range and stability\n  •  Slightly increases handling speed"},{"name":"Extended Barrel","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/d9e5e8fa07a84c29252b78b0e7b3106d.png","desc":"Weighty barrel extension.\n  •  Increases range\n  •  Decreases handling speed\n  •  Moderately controls recoil"},{"name":"Fluted Barrel","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/260eba9dd149dbb94b1306c9ed4dd8db.png","desc":"Ultra-light barrel. \n  •  Greatly increases handling speed\n  •  Slightly increases stability"},{"name":"Full Bore","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/40a4bdcf0f5a4e492927f9569eaf529d.png","desc":"Barrel optimized for distance.\n  •  Greatly increases range\n  •  Decreases stability\n  •  Slightly decreases handling speed"},{"name":"Hammer-Forged Rifling","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/2b9eb6d4489cffc18c10223279198bcc.png","desc":"Durable ranged barrel.\n  •  Increases range"},{"name":"Polygonal Rifling","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7d7aaccee29cf450d4057a9de871cdc8.png","desc":"Barrel optimized for recoil reduction.\n  •  Increases stability"},{"name":"Smallbore","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7d1bb6a623f14959a47156ee71acfc3a.png","desc":"Dual strength barrel.\n  •  Increases range\n  •  Increases stability"},{"name":"Full Choke","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/629246e67fc8690d56b5478b0262131a.png","desc":"Tightened barrel. Reduces projectile spread when aiming down sights at the cost of precision damage."},{"name":"Rifled Barrel","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/79d5f1f469d3290cfb849f4b3e6fc16b.png","desc":"Ranged shotgun barrel.\n  •  Increases range\n  •  Greatly decreases handling speed"}]},{"label":"Battery","weight":1,"perks":[{"name":"Accelerated Coils","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a51d91da9fb0a4c8f45b2ffa89e51ad7.png","desc":"Speeds up charge.\n  •  Faster charge time\n  •  Decreases impact damage"},{"name":"Enhanced Battery","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0ee59b61e99c52c85c2ea18ab705f700.png","desc":"Strong battery life.\n  •  Increases magazine size"},{"name":"Ionized Battery","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a278b79aba1d341d2a070c0e48d9129a.png","desc":"Large heavy battery.\n  •  Greatly increases magazine size\n  •  Greatly decreases reload speed"},{"name":"Liquid Coils","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/01e813d983526b009b4e1c700a1d0081.png","desc":"Slower-building charge for higher damage.\n  •  Increases impact damage\n  •  Slower charge time"},{"name":"Particle Repeater","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8a273117023794757631a34803314351.png","desc":"Improves stability. \n  •  Increases stability"},{"name":"Projection Fuse","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/eaa6fcec699a88e768782068d5e509e1.png","desc":"Distance optimizations.\n  •  Increases range"}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Threat Detector","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9611bdbc48aff898193fd5f705c7cf30.png","desc":"Increased reload, stability, and handling when enemies are in close proximity."},{"name":"Kill Clip","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0afd4799427004b2d8170ab213a2ef0c.png","desc":"Reloading after a kill grants increased damage."},{"name":"Envious Assassin","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/bf7fccf6de8ee6d2e9e6285c004a4758.png","desc":"Defeating targets with other weapons before drawing this one transfers ammo to the magazine from reserves. This effect can overflow the magazine based on the number of targets defeated."},{"name":"Under Pressure","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ac8ec81cd8139434a4b19e459bd9b8ff.png","desc":"Improved stability and accuracy as the magazine gets lower."},{"name":"Rewind Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a201fd61905b802867b677cf927e6e04.png","desc":"When this weapon's magazine is empty, it refills from reserves based on the number of hits."},{"name":"Slideways","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/531db7656c3f2ed054898e141d85b801.png","desc":"Sliding partially reloads this weapon's magazine and temporarily boosts handling and stability."},{"name":"Reconstruction","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9b0c09a784bc7af2f7d038e3626832a9.png","desc":"This weapon slowly reloads itself over time, up to double capacity."},{"name":"Collective Demolition","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/47894c30f18dabf52f84aa514b63b5ea.png","desc":"Collecting an Elemental pickup or destroying a Tangle grants this weapon a stacking period of grenade energy generation on hit. Throwing a Tangle provides additional time.\n\nElemental pickups include [Solar]Firesprites, [Void]Void Breaches, [Arc]Ionic Traces, [Stasis]Stasis Shards, and [Strand]Strand Tangles."},{"name":"Demolitionist","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/da009697110e06b65d6f827b3b6d5f70.png","desc":"Kills with this weapon generate grenade energy. Activating your grenade ability reloads this weapon from reserves."},{"name":"Snapshot Sights","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ce16c9e2cbd73bb548af3e15bdfc7177.png","desc":"Faster time to aim down sights."},{"name":"Auto-Loading Holster","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/e4262099a1c2cea78b48a6680c5248c9.png","desc":"The holstered weapon is automatically reloaded after a short period of time."}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"High-Impact Reserves","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/33ed859a08f2ccf643a1ac3c7f201966.png","desc":"Rounds at the end of the magazine deal more damage."},{"name":"Collective Action","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/901c6420954a4e60fc8a521960f556a8.png","desc":"Collecting an Elemental pickup or destroying a Tangle grants this weapon a stacking period of increased damage. Throwing a Tangle provides additional time.\n\nElemental pickups include [Solar]Firesprites, [Void]Void Breaches, [Arc]Ionic Traces, [Stasis]Stasis Shards, and [Strand]Strand Tangles."},{"name":"Backup Plan","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/479552737ba5ccd1ef34d33be9c2537f.png","desc":"Grants reduced charge time and increased handling speed for a short time immediately after swapping to this weapon."},{"name":"Controlled Burst","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9fd6e7728f412a69a653e5b49d752895.png","desc":"Landing every shot in a burst grants this weapon increased damage and reduced charge time for a short duration."},{"name":"Golden Tricorn","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8ad63f37f2513f56892e0ed20621f5dc.png","desc":"Final blows with this weapon grant bonus damage. While this buff is active, grenade or melee kills of the same damage type greatly increase its damage and duration."},{"name":"Rangefinder","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/74270d52bec24f1f5f4c987f5f37fce9.png","desc":"Aiming this weapon increases its effective range and zoom magnification. Increased projectile velocity while aiming Rocket Launchers, Grenade Launchers, and Bows."},{"name":"Kickstart","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7bebeaee2c1cdad96ea43f47999579af.png","desc":"Gain bonus damage and charge rate during a slide after sprinting for a short duration."},{"name":"Aggregate Charge","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/35b9761aa61c2180059b9ba349c04dcf.png","desc":"This weapon deals more damage for each elemental debuff applied to the target."},{"name":"Voltshot","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a71ffb1cb221ea64fa77ab473f8a3a61.png","desc":"Reloading this weapon after defeating a target overcharges this weapon for a short period of time, causing it to jolt on its next hit."},{"name":"Golden Tricorn Enhanced","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8ad63f37f2513f56892e0ed20621f5dc.png","desc":"Final blows with this weapon grant bonus damage for an improved duration. While this buff is active, grenade or melee final blows of the same damage type greatly increase its damage for an improved duration."},{"name":"Rampage","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8976ead57430e4f5f8af1b3005de4f83.png","desc":"Kills with this weapon temporarily grant increased damage. Stacks 3x."}]}],"modes":{"all":{"rolls":[[4,11,20,28],[0,16,20,33],[0,11,20,28],[0,11,20,33],[0,14,18,38],[0,16,20,28],[4,11,20,33],[4,16,20,28],[4,16,20,33],[6,11,20,28],[6,11,20,33],[6,16,20,28],[6,16,20,33],[0,11,26,28],[0,11,26,33],[0,12,18,38],[0,16,26,28],[0,16,26,33],[2,12,18,38],[2,14,18,38],[4,11,26,28],[4,11,26,33],[4,12,18,38],[4,14,18,38],[4,16,26,28],[4,16,26,33],[6,11,26,28],[6,11,26,33],[6,16,26,28],[6,16,26,33],[0,11,18,38],[0,11,20,30],[0,11,20,38],[0,11,21,31],[0,11,23,31],[0,12,18,28],[0,12,20,28],[0,12,20,30],[0,12,20,33],[0,12,20,38],[0,13,18,28],[0,13,18,38],[0,13,21,31],[0,13,23,31],[0,14,18,28],[0,14,20,38],[0,14,21,31],[0,14,23,31],[0,15,18,38],[0,15,20,28],[0,15,20,30],[0,15,20,33],[0,15,20,38],[0,16,18,31],[0,16,18,33],[0,16,18,34],[0,16,20,30],[0,16,20,31],[0,16,20,34],[0,16,23,31],[0,16,23,33],[0,16,23,34],[1,11,18,38],[1,11,20,28],[1,11,20,30],[1,11,20,33],[1,11,20,38],[1,12,18,38],[1,12,20,28],[1,12,20,30],[1,12,20,33],[1,12,20,38],[1,14,18,38],[1,14,20,38],[1,15,18,38],[1,15,20,28],[1,15,20,30],[1,15,20,33],[1,15,20,38],[1,16,20,28],[1,16,20,30],[1,16,20,33],[2,11,18,38],[2,11,20,28],[2,11,20,30],[2,11,20,33],[2